// Friend 05 (friend-05-big.svg, added to the workbench 2026-08-10) —
// one of Kimia's nine traced archetype drawings, imported and assembled
// exactly like friend10.jsx and the storyteller: the traced layers are
// kept verbatim in their source paint order and only the shade RAMP is
// swapped, so one drawing can be shown in any candidate body colour.
//
// A BANDED trace, like friend-10: the seven tonal bands do not overlap
// (each shade covers only its own region) and the original's darkest
// layer was LOST in tracing, leaving holes through the figure — proved
// on a magenta test ground. THE RECONSTRUCTED BASE below is that
// missing layer, rebuilt the friend10.jsx way: every band sampled and
// unioned, hairline cracks sealed, exterior rings kept (which fills the
// holes), crumbs dropped. It sits BEHIND the bands as an extra darkest
// ramp shade, and it is also the shape the glow aura blurs.
//
// The seal here is 8x friend 10's, Kimia's call on 2026-08-10 after
// checking the first pass against her character sheet: these creatures
// are continuous bodies there, not filigree, so the gaps wanted closing
// harder. The figure is that much more solid than the bands alone paint.
//
// Assembled per the friend conventions (design-bible §3, §7, §9c): Kimia's
// traced eye placeholders are replaced by the canonical yellow <Eye/> at
// their measured centres; the body glows its own colour; the eyes blink in
// their own featherweight overlay svg — the body/eyes split is load-bearing
// (see storyteller.jsx).
//
// COLOURS ARE STAND-INS. TODO(T5.2): move the ramps into the CSS
// design-tokens file once it exists, like every other asset here.

